  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="27">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 27</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se on gemote mid wiðertihtlan hine sylfne oððe his man werie, hæbbe eall þæt forspecen ⁊ geandwyrde ðam oðrum, swa hundrede riht ðynce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who in Court tries to protect either himself or one of his men by bringing a countercharge shall have wasted his words, and shall meet the charge brought by his opponent in such a way as the hundred court shall determine.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And se ðe on gemote mid wiðertihtlan hine sylfne oððon his mann werige, hæbbe þæt eall forspecen, ⁊ geandwerde ðam oþrum, swa hundrede riht þynce.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
